    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25903" root="ضفدع" body-key="D">
    
      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَفْدَعَ</span></b> , said of water, <i>It had in it</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَفَادِع</span>
[or <i>frogs</i>]. (O, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And, said of a man, <i>He
shrank,</i> or <i>became contracted;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَقَبَّضَ</span>: or <i>he
voided his excrement,</i> or <i>ordure;</i> or <i>thin excrement;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلَحَ</span>: or <i>he emitted wind from the
anus, with a sound.</i> (TA.)

